; Bastion (issue #403, a Capture the Flag stage): a closed hall 1440 wide with a low plinth at each end carrying that team's flag,
; and a ledge either side of a centre platform. Symmetric left to right. Two teams of up to four start on their own sides.
; Rotation (Stage.mode_weights): weighted 4x for Capture the Flag, and in any other mode dealt into a bag only 30% of the time.
